			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18033008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">
				“Surely you 
				<crossref let="p" cid="c18033008.15">
				</crossref>
				have spoken, 
				<crossref let="q" cid="c18033008.16">
				</crossref>
				in my ears, and I have heard the sound of your words.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18033009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">
				You say, 
				<crossref let="r" cid="c18033009.17">
				</crossref>
				‘I am, 
				<crossref let="s" cid="c18033009.18">
				</crossref>
				pure, without transgression; I am clean, and there is no iniquity in me.
				<note nid="n18033009.9">
				</note>
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18033010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">
				Behold, he 
				<crossref let="t" cid="c18033010.19">
				</crossref>
				finds occasions, 
				<crossref let="u" cid="c18033010.20">
				</crossref>
				against me, he counts me as his enemy,
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18033011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">
