				<crossref let="w" cid="c18033011.22">
				</crossref>
				in the stocks and watches all my paths.’
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18033012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">
				“Behold, in 
				<crossref let="x" cid="c18033012.23">
				</crossref>
				this you, 
				<crossref let="y" cid="c18033012.24">
				</crossref>
